[statement]
A package whose `!` entry forbids the package completing its condition is
passed over, not a cause to refuse: `b`, triggered by `d`, conflicts with
`d`, and `d` is installed alone. A conflict with another requested
package refuses the request
(`install-if/a-conflict-with-the-request-refuses-it`).

[repository]
P:b
V:1
D:!d
i:d

P:d
V:3

[request]
d

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install d 3
